 chief have the attention of the Indian government. But experts say toppling it is another matter.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India opposition huddle over tea after thousands march in their Delhi protest</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e555b1c57e5970d6add61541ea17780345fd3ff93e324073e13cb584dfea2694</id><updated>2026-10-14T05:04:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T06:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-opposition-huddle-over-tea-after-thousands-march-in-their-delhi-protest/live-79646819--4d3738030bbd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-opposition-huddle-over-tea-after-thousands-march-in-their-delhi-protest/live-79646819?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Congress' Rahul Gandhi hosted oppositon MPs for tea after rallying thousands in Monday's election protest. The 'Cockroach' movement says its leaders have been detained during a flash protest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Starlink India launch: Why Elon Musk is still waiting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d0528add12358efe15156613be6e9f685c2278ada901a413f4b0df2081f8cd19</id><updated>2026-10-14T05:04:53Z</updated><published>2026-10-12T14:33:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/starlink-india-launch-why-elon-musk-is-still-waiting/a-79643043--4f745799dbba.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/starlink-india-launch-why-elon-musk-is-still-waiting/a-79643043?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite securing key approvals, the Starlink satellite internet service remains in regulatory limbo, raising questions about security clearances, competition and India’s investment climate.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Opposition parties march to Supreme Court</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c1ef4018bfd55a9552b169006c614fed9d157dd984494934cc4165f96faf8f60</id><up